exports[`Hoy en inglés (#299) > Hoy completo: meta semanal, tu semana, números y peso en lb 1`] = `"Monday, November 9 Good morning , Andrés How does it work? 11 A Monday, strength day Total strength: legs, chest and shoulders Legs, chest and shoulders with a weight that goes up every week: more strength for everything, from carrying groceries to climbing stairs. 46 minutes 4 exercises 13 sets (rounds) Start today's workout , about 46 minutes How do you feel today? Optional Pick one and Coach Banana adjusts your workout to how you feel today. Tired One less set, lighter Normal Your plan as is All in One extra rep Coach Banana Today you build base strength in your legs, chest and shoulders. Last time you did back squat with 197.5 lb × 6: today try 7 reps. What you'll do Swipe to see them all 1 Back squat 4 sets of 5 to 8 Works: Legs See how it's done 2 Bench press 4 sets of 6 to 10 Works: Chest See how it's done 3 Standing overhead press 3 sets of 6 to 10 Works: Shoulders See how it's done 4 Weighted dips 2 sets of 8 to 12 Works: Triceps See how it's done A set is a round of reps in a row. You rest between sets. Yesterday Active rest Tomorrow Wide back and strong biceps This week: 0 of 6 workouts 1 week hitting your goal Daily streak: 11 days See my progress Nuevo: entrena en casa Cambia a modo casa en tu perfil y tu rutina se adapta a mancuernas y peso corporal. Probar Esta semana: 0 km Faltan 48 días para tu carrera Your numbers today Food Left 1,240 kcal You ate 1,260 kcal Your goal 2,500 kcal Protein 101 / 185 g 84 g to go. Protein protects your muscle while you lose fat. Carbs 141 / 283 g Energy to train Fat 28 / 70 g Hormones and fullness What have you eaten today? Log food Breakfast Arroz con frijoles y huevos revueltos 430 kcal, 28 g protein Lunch Pollo con arroz, frijoles y plátano 620 kcal, 52 g protein Snack Yogur griego con papaya 210 kcal, 21 g protein Dinner Log Coach Banana recommends. For your snack: Huevos en taza de microondas 360 kcal and 40 g of protein (2 servings) These work too: Tilapia al limón con yuca. See the recipe You eat about 500 kcal less than you burn: that's how you lose fat at a good pace. See my meal plan Water 5 / 8 glasses 1 glass Steps 4,820 / 10,000 1,000 Sleep 7.5 / 8 h ½ h Coach Banana exprés ¿Te estás quedando sin tiempo? Termina con estos exprés Sin equipo, con tu peso, en un espacio de 2 × 2 m. Cuenta para tu racha . Entreno exprés de 10 min Activa Despierta el cuerpo Entreno exprés de 20 min Quema Sube pulsaciones Entreno exprés de 30 min Completo Cuerpo completo Your week See plan Workouts 0 / 6 Streak 11 days XP points 0 M today T coming up W coming up T coming up F coming up S coming up S - rest 6 workouts to go to complete your week. Every workout counts to keep your muscle. Level 4: Big Plantain +0 XP today 310 XP to go for Strong Monkey Weekly goal: 0 of 700 XP Train +10 XP per set Your challenges Challenge shop 30 días Banana Día 11 de 30 10 / 30 Racha 10 días seguidos Comodines 3 de 3 comodines comodines Meta 10 / 27 para la medalla Hoy: Completa cualquier entreno; si te falta energía, usa el modo suave Se marca solo al guardar tu entreno Faltan 4 días cumplidos para el hito del día 14 (+ 25 XP) Ver calendario Rey de las flexiones Día 3 de 30 2 / 30 Racha 2 días seguidos Comodines 3 de 3 comodines comodines Meta 2 / 27 para la medalla Hoy: 16 flexiones en total hoy (en las series que quieras) Hecho Faltan 5 días cumplidos para el hito del día 7 (+ 25 XP) Ver calendario Did you weigh in yet? See trend When you wake up, after the bathroom, before eating. 205.3 lb Save −4.0 lb lost 17.9 lb to goal 52 days Coach Banana 3-1-1 tempo on every rep. Lowering slowly is where muscle is built."`;

exports[`Hoy en inglés (#299) > primer día: saludo, fecha, el primer entreno y sus botones en inglés 1`] = `"Monday, November 9 Good morning , Andrés 11 A Full body to get started Your first workout Start my workout About 15 min Start at home No equipment, about 12 min What you'll do Swipe to see them all 1 Goblet squat 2 sets of 8 to 12 Works: Legs See how it's done 2 Incline dumbbell press 2 sets of 8 to 12 Works: Chest See how it's done 3 Lat pulldown 2 sets of 8 to 12 Works: Back See how it's done A set is a round of reps in a row. You rest between sets. Yesterday Active rest Tomorrow Wide back and strong biceps"`;
